{"run_id": "2f02ba138a9c4ffc8bb02b5a31af2963", "sequence": 4, "time": "2026-10-29T16:40:18.265857+00:00", "event": "tool_result", "call_id": "n04-1-0", "name": "search_documents", "observation": {"ok": true, "mode": "hybrid", "hits": [{"doc_id": "D07", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c001", "title": "设备申领指南", "topic": "设备申领", "scope": "新入职员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r001", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["设备申领指南", "正文"], "token_count": 61, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D07-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/markdown/D07_设备申领指南.md", "sha256": "bf39d195bc01cc0e1b8c9bcfa4471500b95b5ed3bcb02b8ef671ad89c4c3cbf8", "method": "markdown", "page": null, "bbox": null, "line_start": 13, "line_end": 13, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "新入职员工可通过资产系统申请一台工作笔记本电脑，经直属主管审批后由行政部门发放。", "rrf_score": 0.031545, "bm25_score": 1.781195, "vector_score": 0.679281}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c002", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r002", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第二节 申请前准备"], "token_count": 224, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 323.1171875, 145.75, 334.6171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 349.9765625, 541.5, 377.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 393.9765625, 552.0, 421.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第二节 申请前准备\n\n首次使用须在服务台申请开通。申请前应确认企业账号可正常使用，准备说明访问的内部系统、业务原因和预计使用场景。不要在申请说明中填写账号密码或动态验证码。本文不提供真实服务台网址和下载链接。\n\n申请人应确认本地网络可以正常访问公共网络，并核对设备时间。公共网络本身不可用时，即使VPN账号已开通也可能无法建立连接。是否允许使用个人设备、公共电", "rrf_score": 0.030886, "bm25_score": 4.376706, "vector_score": 0.524734}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c013", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r013", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第十三节 工单填写模板"], "token_count": 241, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 184.6171875, 168.75, 196.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 211.4765625, 546.75, 256.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 272.9765625, 541.5, 318.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第十三节 工单填写模板\n\n问题摘要应写明“在哪一步、出现什么现象、影响哪个系统”。例如“已显示连接成功，但内部知识系统页面超时”比“VPN坏了”更便于处理。再填写发生时间、客户端提示、网络类型、影响范围和已尝试步骤。示例不包含真实系统地址。\n\n工单不应把未经确认的猜测写成结论。可以写“怀疑与网络切换有关，尚未确认”，但不要写成“服务端已经故障”。若其他同事遇", "rrf_score": 0.016129, "bm25_score": 0.800233, "vector_score": 0.551909}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c015", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r015", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第十五节 可疑登录与凭据泄露"], "token_count": 233, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 479.1171875, 203.25, 490.6171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 505.9765625, 541.5, 533.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 549.9765625, 546.75, 577.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第十五节 可疑登录与凭据泄露\n\n如果误把验证码发给他人、发现本人未发起的验证请求或看到异常登录提示，应停止相关操作并通过企业确认的渠道报告。不要继续向未知联系人提供新的验证码，也不要按陌生消息要求安装不明远程控制软件。\n\n本文仅给出报告原则，不规定账号冻结权限、密码重置步骤或安全事件分级。具体处置需查阅账号与安全事件制度。VPN连接成功不代表某条外部消息可信", "rrf_score": 0.016129, "bm25_score": 3.322765, "vector_score": 0.500118}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c005", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r005", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第五节 建立连接"], "token_count": 208, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 184.6171875, 134.25, 196.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 211.4765625, 546.75, 239.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 255.4765625, 541.5, 283.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第五节 建立连接\n\n审批通过后使用企业账号和动态验证码登录。启动企业确认的VPN客户端，核对接入配置，输入本人企业账号，并按照界面要求完成动态验证。验证码应在有效期内使用，不应复制给他人代为登录。\n\n连接过程中应观察界面提示，区分正在连接、验证失败、连接超时和已连接。客户端显示已连接后，再尝试访问获准使用的内部系统。不要因登录过程耗时而连续重复提交，以免混淆", "rrf_score": 0.015873, "bm25_score": 0.863402, "vector_score": 0.550284}, {"doc_id": "D04", "version_date": "2026-02-01", "chunk_id": "c004", "title": "出差住宿规则", "topic": "住宿", "scope": "国内出差", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r004", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["出差住宿规则", "第四条 表格与后续流程"], "token_count": 137, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 600.1171875, 168.75, 611.6171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 626.9765625, 541.5, 672.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第四条 表格与后续流程\n\n表A提供城市行、限额和不同业务场景下的材料提醒，材料提醒不是新的金额豁免。第6页说明申请、入住变更、退款和异常处理。费用报销提交期限应另查报销制度；本文没有授权用住宿限额规则消解其他文件的期限冲突。", "rrf_score": 0.015873, "bm25_score": 3.252662, "vector_score": 0.341598}]}}
